WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hi, Erin.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Erin Smith: Hey, Carmen, how are you?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Good, how are you?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Erin Smith: Good. It's a little noisy here, because I'm getting a new washing machine, and it's like…

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: That's it.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, it's like…

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Erin Smith: Direct.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, is it?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Erin Smith: It's.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Erin Smith: Like, I feel, I keep feeling like the walls are falling.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Like you're like tumbling with it.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Erin Smith: Yeah, exactly. So.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Is it getting installed, or is it running right now?

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Erin Smith: It's getting installed, so we just… we moved here a month ago, and we… it was broken when we got here, so they're giving us a new one.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay, that's nice.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Erin Smith: But it's stacked, so they have to take everything out and, you know, like, whatever.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, that's a whole hassle.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Erin Smith: Yeah.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, I'm…

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Erin Smith: Anyway, so I wanted to check in. I know we met a few weeks ago. Our our ad is really kind of.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Erin Smith: falling off of it, um, and our… I'm just wondering, I know we had talked about, like, maybe a refresh or something, um.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Erin Smith: But you know it's some weeks like back we had.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Erin Smith: 7 leads, 5 leads, 4, but, like, this week, last week…

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Erin Smith: you know, basically, in the past 5 weeks, I think we've gotten 12 leads total which feels lower than in weeks past or in months past. So I'm just wondering. I was looking at like.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:49.000
Erin Smith: My notes and you had said something about a refresh, but I wasn't sure exactly how I should handle that.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Erin Smith: Um…

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Erin Smith: And when we met on the 24th we paused the ceremony. Only we updated. We upped the budget for the search.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Erin Smith: Um, and then I had the notes add refresh for mid-October, so…

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, what I'm gonna do, just… I'll take 10 seconds, so we have an… I don't know if I told you this already, but we have an AI that, like, really deep dives into the account, so I'm just gonna take advantage of that real quick and get it to do a quick scrape, and then I'll look at it myself.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Erin Smith: Okay, perfect.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:36.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, because I checked, like, the past, like, starting October, and it looks like you guys just got one lead, and then past 30 days has been, like, seven, which is still not that healthy.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So one second.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Erin Smith: Yeah, and it really has gone down, um, and also, like, our click-through rate used to be a lot higher, um, and it seems that it's just, like, consistently, like.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:56.000
Erin Smith: 8, 9, like, we've had weeks where it's 13, 12, like, way higher click-through rate, so…

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:03.000
Erin Smith: Maybe it's the time of year, but, like, November really is, like, the start of…

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.000
Erin Smith: uh… engagement season, so I feel like we need to, like, figure it out now.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, 100%.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.000
Erin Smith: Uh, not that one, no.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Do we have two campaigns active or just one?

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.000
Erin Smith: No, that's an old one, that one.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.000
Erin Smith: It should be, um, just the search…

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, just wanted to know.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.000
Erin Smith: Yeah, that one.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:37.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I know this, like, sounds like a cheap metric, because of course, like, it matters what you guys are getting on your end, but I do like how you do have a 9% click-through rate. But I also do want to check if, like, any keyword.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:45.000
Carmen Cruickshank: are leaking or just causing clicks, but no buyers. So, like, high click-through rate's good, but it's not, like, always good.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.000
Erin Smith: Mm-hmm.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It really depends on conversions. I'm going to check search terms.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:04.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Most of these look relevant, at least from the top, like with impressions.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.000
Erin Smith: Mm-hmm.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:10.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Wedding roles… I'm gonna see what actually caused conversions. Oh, so, okay, so these ones were, like…

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: top converting ones, Wedding Halls NYC, and then Atmosphere Astoria, which I know we excluded now.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.000
Erin Smith: Mm-hmm.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Was that a competitor?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:31.000
Erin Smith: Yeah, it's… it's funny, that was the first time I heard of it, and then I've seen it, like, a whole bunch of other places, so… I don't even think they're a competitor, they're just another venue.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yep.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, okay.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I'm going to do what got most clicks. Okay.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Carmen Cruickshank: The Arches, Brooklyn, is that a competitor?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:44.000
Erin Smith: Yeah. That's a competitor.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:46.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, okay. Are they similar to you guys, or like…

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:49.000
Erin Smith: Um, let's see.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.000
Carmen Cruickshank: different.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:01.000
Erin Smith: Uh, I don't even know where they are. It says Luxury Brooklyn Event Venue.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hmm.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.000
Erin Smith: I guess they're similar.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:11.000
Erin Smith: But they don't have a garden, so that's different.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, okay. Yeah, it's interesting.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:24.000
Erin Smith: I will say that in our meeting this week, we learned, like, two venues in our area are kind of really hurting, like…

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:34.000
Erin Smith: like, can't, you know, they're not booking enough to pay their rent, kind of thing, so I don't know if there's just, like, an overall dip, but, um…

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Maybe. Like…

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.000
Erin Smith: Or, oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.000
