00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.000
Erin Smith: No, I was gonna say, or is it…

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:49.000
Erin Smith: I wanted to ask if these ads are getting shown to the same people or is it always being delivered to new people?

00:05:49.000 --> 00:06:05.000
Carmen Cruickshank: That's a good question, like, because I know audiences can change sometimes, because unlike Facebook, where we target more, like, gender and age and interest, this one is keywords, so demographics could change over time of what keywords people are searching, but.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: for the most part, it should be the same. I do notice, though, like, I don't always see micro-wedding at the top.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:17.000
