00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.000
Erin Smith: Yeah, we do micro weddings.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:07:01.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, okay. That could be a possibility of, like, possibly having an ad group that…

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: is for micro weddings, and we have, like, a micro wedding landing page for that. Uh, that might speak to more people, but I do see also, like, you know, backyard wedding venues, so again, I don't.

