Carmen Cruickshank: an association with it being cheaper.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.000
Erin Smith: Mmm.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:24.000
Carmen Cruickshank: But… that's interesting. Why do you think also those two other wedding venues are lowering on business? Like, what do you think? Is it, like, a location thing? A them thing?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:34.000
Erin Smith: Um, I don't know, they just… one of them is… I think the other one with the garden is changing management, so they've really… they're trying to…

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:50.000
Erin Smith: uh, fix things. We are seeing this micro wedding trend, and maybe the other venue… the other venue I know is a lot bigger than ours, so that might be why they're hurting. Um, but we're definitely, like, the sweet spot for us.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:55.000
Erin Smith: is like 40 to 60 people like that's a really good.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.000
Erin Smith: size wedding for us.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:05.000
