00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So with…

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:35.000
Carmen Cruickshank: you know, the structure of an ad, it's like the overall campaign, which is where we control the budget, and then different subtopics within that campaign. So, of course, our main campaign is weddings.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:43.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And for the ad groups, we just have promoting the wedding venue, but I think what we could do is we could just add a sub…

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:58.000
Carmen Cruickshank: topic ad group under this campaign, so it wouldn't increase the budget of basically, like, micro weddings. So we have, like, basic wedding venue, and then micro wedding venue. Uh, and then we would just add, like, maybe 4 or 5 micro wedding keywords.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.000
Erin Smith: Okay.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:09.000
Carmen Cruickshank: change some of the headline and descriptions to, of course, fit the micro weddings, and then that's basically it. Uh, I do want to see what…

